# Seifer Almasy {3}{R}, 3/4: "Whenever a creature you control attacks alone, it gains double strike until end of turn." and "Fire
# Cross - Whenever Seifer deals combat damage to a player, you may cast target instant or sorcery card with mana value 3 or less from
# your graveyard without paying its mana cost. If that spell would be put into your graveyard, exile it instead." Bot1 casts a
# Lightning Bolt on turn 1 (Bot2 17) and a Shock on turn 3 (15), both into its graveyard, and Seifer on turn 3. On turn 5 Seifer
# attacks alone: double strike (CR 702.4) deals 3 in the first-strike damage step and 3 in the regular one (15 to 9), and each deals
# combat damage to a player so Fire Cross triggers twice: the Bolt is recast free (3, to 6), then the Shock (2, to 4). Both are exiled
# instead of going to the graveyard, and no mana is spent.

